            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>General</h2><ul><li><p>New: Overclocking and Force Original Hardware are now adjustable in-game <superscript>1</superscript></p></li></ul><h2>OS</h2><ul><li><p>Improved: 3DOS update files are moved to ‘/System/Archived’ on the SD card after updating</p></li><li><p>Fix: Issue with R&amp;D &lt;menu&gt; toggles</p></li></ul><p></p><p><em>Note: The last stage of this OS update may take longer than normal.</em></p><ol><li><p><em>For more information visit the </em><a href="https://www.analogue.co/developer/docs/platform/library-json"><em>Platform docs</em></a></p></li></ol>]]></content:encoded>
